#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:936
#, no-c-format
msgid "Frequently asked questions"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:941
#, no-c-format
msgid "Who made this game?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:942
#, no-c-format
msgid "The kdegames team. You can find their website here."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:945
#, no-c-format
msgid "Where can I get cheatcodes?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:946
#, no-c-format
msgid "You can't get cheatcodes for KDE games."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:949
#, no-c-format
msgid "How do I start a new game?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:950
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To start a new game use <menuchoice> <shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul"
"\">&Ctrl;<keycap>N</keycap></keycombo></shortcut> <guimenu>Game</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>New</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> on the menubar."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:957
#, no-c-format
msgid "How do I restart a my current game?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:958
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To restart a current game use <menuchoice> <shortcut><keycap>F5</keycap></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Game</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Restart Game</guimenuitem> </"
"menuchoice> on the menubar."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:965
#, no-c-format
msgid "How do I pause the game?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:966
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kappname; features no 'Pause' function at the moment."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:969
#, no-c-format
msgid "I want to change the way this game looks. Can I?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:970
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can change the faces and backs of the playing cards. To do so please use "
"<menuchoice> <shortcut><keycap>F10</keycap></shortcut> <guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu> <guimenuitem>Select Deck...</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> on the "
"menubar. See <link linkend=\"configuration\">Game Configuration</link> "
"section for details."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:977
#, no-c-format
msgid "I have made a mistake. Can I undo?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:978
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Yes. To undo a wrong move you can use <menuchoice> <shortcut><keycombo "
"action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Z</keycap></keycombo></shortcut> "
"<guimenu>Move</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Undo</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> on the "
"menubar."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:985
#, no-c-format
msgid "Can I use keyboard?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:986
#, no-c-format
msgid "No. &kappname; features no possible keyboard play."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:989
#, no-c-format
msgid "I can't figure out what to do here! Are there hints?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:990
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Yes. To take advantage of the 'Hint' feature use <menuchoice> "
"<shortcut><keycap>H</keycap></shortcut> <guimenu>Game</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Hint</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> on the menubar."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:997
#, no-c-format
msgid "Even with hints I still have no clue how to play. Help!"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:998
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Besides the 'Hint' feature there also is a useful 'Demo' mode, where the "
"built in artificial intelligence will play the game for you. You can try to "
"watch and learn. However, if you have any questions it is better to read "
"<link linkend=\"howto\">How to Play</link> and <link linkend=\"rules_and_tips"
"\">Game Rules, and Strategies and Tips</link> sections of this docbook."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1001
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"I have to quit the game now, but I'm not finished yet. Can I save my "
"progress?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1002
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
